1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:09,000
MatchProof checks eligibility for matchmaking agencies.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,700
This demo uses synthetic data on Midnight Local Devnet.

3
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:25,433
The issuer checks evidence and gives the applicant a
credential.

4
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:32,567
The agency creates a request. The applicant consents and
proves.

5
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:39,700
Midnight verifies the proof. The agency reads the
approval.

6
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,000
The credential is bound to the applicant.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,700
This issuance was confirmed before recording.

8
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:58,100
The applicant imports the credential into an encrypted
vault.

9
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,900
Synthetic income: KRW 65 million in 2025.

10
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:09,700
The agency does not receive this credential file.

11
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:17,150
The agency creates DEMO-003, valid for ten minutes.

12
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:24,000
Policy: 2025 income of KRW 50 million or more,

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,850
and not married on the evidence check date.

14
00:01:30,850 --> 00:01:37,700
Evidence must remain within seven days through the
deadline.

15
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:43,650
The applicant reviews the recipient, conditions and
deadline.

16
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:49,000
Exact income and original documents are not disclosed.

17
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:54,350
With both files imported, the proof button still needs
consent.

18
00:01:54,350 --> 00:01:59,700
The applicant agrees to disclose the result for this
request.

19
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:06,580
Compact checks the credential, applicant key and request.

20
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:12,860
The off-chain prover processes private inputs.

21
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:19,140
The development test wallet signs automatically.

22
00:02:19,140 --> 00:02:28,000
This take: about 24.3 seconds from click to confirmation.

23
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:31,700
The chain has now confirmed the proof transaction.

24
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:38,767
DEMO-003 now shows Conditions met.

25
00:02:38,767 --> 00:02:45,233
Its public request ID starts with f2f55ca6.

26
00:02:45,233 --> 00:02:51,700
The agency does not receive exact income or the
credential.

27
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:58,767
A separate browser reads the same public request.

28
00:02:58,767 --> 00:03:05,233
No connected wallet or applicant credential is needed.

29
00:03:05,233 --> 00:03:11,700
The indexer is off-chain. The app relies on its response.

30
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:18,100
DEMO-002 uses a credential with KRW 30 million income.

31
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:23,900
The local circuit rejects it before transaction
submission.

32
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:29,700
The detailed failure reason appears only to the applicant.

33
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:34,000
DEMO-002 remains unapproved.

34
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,700
The agency sees no detailed failure reason.

35
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:45,433
Ten-minute expiry limits use of the request.

36
00:03:45,433 --> 00:03:52,567
It does not delete historical chain records.

37
00:03:52,567 --> 00:03:59,700
The current contract has no deletion or immediate
revocation.

38
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:06,180
Verified: issuance, requests, proof confirmation and
public reads.

39
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:12,060
A fresh public clone passed compilation, build and 38
tests.

40
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:17,940
Evidence truth relies on the issuer. No government
integration.

41
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:23,820
MatchProof reduces detailed data collected by the agency.

42
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:29,700
Source and run instructions: github.com/team-
hyunjae/MatchProof
